:name: Twin Sensor Node
:description: Digital twin of boardtwin/twin_sensor: MCUboot + signed application.
:
: Usage (from the west workspace root):
:   renode zephyr-cra-starter/renode/twin_sensor.resc
: Override images with: $bootloader=@path/to/mcuboot.elf $app=@path/to/app.signed.hex

$name?="twin_sensor"
$bootloader?=@build/mcuboot/zephyr/zephyr.elf
$app?=@build/app/zephyr/zephyr.signed.hex

using sysbus
mach create $name
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/twin_sensor.repl
# Flash controller model missing from Renode's nRF52840 platform.
machine PyDevFromFile $ORIGIN/nrf52840_nvmc.py 0x4001E000 0x1000 True "nvmc"
# Factory/user configuration values that real silicon provides.
sysbus Tag <0x10000010, 0x10000013> "FICR.CODEPAGESIZE" 0x1000
sysbus Tag <0x10000014, 0x10000017> "FICR.CODESIZE" 0x100
sysbus Tag <0x10001200, 0x10001203> "UICR.PSELRESET[0]" 0x12
sysbus Tag <0x10001204, 0x10001207> "UICR.PSELRESET[1]" 0x12

# Sensible defaults for the simulated environment (change at runtime, e.g.
# `sysbus.twi0.env Temperature 30`).
twi0.env Temperature 21.5
twi0.env Humidity 45
twi0.env Pressure 1013
twi0.accel DefaultAccelerationZ 1
twi0.accel AccelerationZ 1

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bootloader
    sysbus LoadHEX $app
"""
runMacro $reset

showAnalyzer uart0
